      "hizbQuarter": 101,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1734,
      "text": "Those who disbelieve say, “Why has no sign been sent down to him from his Lord?” Say, “Allah causes to stray whom He wills and guides to Himself who turns to Him,",
